from lesson_data import P, S, E, Q, finish
LESSON = finish(dict(number=3, prereqs=[1,2],
lead=P("Write a small catalogue program and learn how values, control flow, functions and errors shape its behaviour.", "编写小型目录程序，理解值、控制流、函数与错误如何影响行为。"),
before=P("Use a text editor and terminal. Run a .py file; never name it after a standard-library module such as argparse.py.", "使用编辑器和终端运行 .py 文件；不要取 argparse.py 等与标准库相同的文件名。"),
outcomes=[P("Trace assignments and branches.", "跟踪赋值与分支。"),P("Use lists and dictionaries to represent records.", "用列表和字典表示记录。"),P("Separate logic from input/output.", "分离逻辑与输入输出。"),P("Explain aliasing and mutation.", "解释别名与修改。"),P("Reproduce and diagnose errors.", "复现并诊断错误。")],
sections=[
S("Values, names and expressions", "值、名称与表达式", "<p>A variable name refers to a value. Assignment binds a name; it is not an equation that remains true forever. After x=3; y=x; x=4, y is still 3. Expressions compute values: + adds, == compares, and and/or combine conditions. Types determine which operations make sense; '3'+ '4' concatenates text, while 3+4 adds integers. Convert external text deliberately and handle conversion errors rather than hoping the type is correct.</p>", "<p>变量名称引用值，赋值绑定名称，并非永久成立的等式。x=3、y=x、x=4 后 y 仍为 3。表达式产生值，+ 加法，== 比较，and/or 组合条件。类型决定操作意义：'3'+'4' 拼接文字，3+4 则整数相加。应明确转换外部文字并处理转换错误。</p>", "What is y after the assignments above?", "上述赋值后 y 是多少？", "3; later rebinding x does not rebind y.", "3；重新绑定 x 不会重新绑定 y。"),
S("Selection and repetition", "选择与重复", "<p>if selects a branch; for iterates over a collection; while repeats while its condition is true. Python uses indentation to group statements. An empty collection produces zero for iterations. A while loop needs a progress argument: while count&lt;3 with count+=1 finishes, but forgetting the increment does not. break leaves a loop, continue advances to its next iteration, and return leaves a function. Use a trace table to distinguish these boundaries.</p>", "<p>if 选择分支，for 遍历集合，while 在条件为真时重复。Python 通过缩进组织语句。空集合使 for 执行零次。while 需要推进理由：count&lt;3 并每次 count+=1 会结束，忘记增加则不会。break 离开循环，continue 开始下一迭代，return 离开函数；用轨迹表区分这些边界。</p>", "What happens if the increment in a true while loop is omitted?", "真条件 while 循环缺少递增会怎样？", "Without another exit or state change, it never terminates.", "没有其他退出或状态变化时，不会终止。"),
S("Collections and mutation", "集合与修改", "<p>A list gives ordered items; a dictionary maps keys to values. A book can be {'id':1,'title':'Dune'}. Names can refer to the same mutable object: b=a does not copy a list, so b.append changes the object seen through a. a.copy creates a new outer list, but nested records are still shared. Decide whether a function mutates an argument or returns new data, and document that contract. Avoid changing a list's length while traversing it; construct a filtered result instead.</p>", "<p>列表提供有序项目，字典把键映射到值。图书可表示为 {'id':1,'title':'Dune'}。多个名称可引用同一个可变对象：b=a 不复制列表，因此 b.append 会改变 a 看到的对象。a.copy 创建新的外层列表，但嵌套记录仍共享。明确函数修改参数还是返回新数据。遍历时避免改变列表长度，可构造筛选后的结果。</p>", "Does copying a list copy every nested dictionary?", "复制列表会复制所有嵌套字典吗？", "A shallow copy copies only the outer container.", "浅复制只复制外层容器。"),
S("Functions and interfaces", "函数与接口", "<p>A function has parameters, a body and a result. Local names keep temporary state within a call. Return a result so callers can use it; print produces output but is not a substitute for returning data. Put catalogue search in a function, and let a separate main function parse command-line arguments and print results. This makes the same logic usable from a terminal, tests or a future web server. An if __name__ == '__main__' guard runs the interface when executed directly without running it on import.</p>", "<p>函数包含参数、函数体与结果。局部名称把临时状态限制在调用内。返回数据供调用者使用；print 产生输出，不能代替返回值。把搜索放入函数，由独立 main 解析命令行并打印。这样终端、测试和后续服务器可复用同一逻辑。__name__ 守卫让直接运行时启动接口，导入时不启动。</p>", "Why return records rather than print them inside search?", "为什么搜索应返回记录而非直接打印？", "Different callers can format, test or transmit the same result.", "不同调用者可格式化、测试或传输同一结果。"),
S("Errors and debugging", "错误与调试", "<p>Syntax errors prevent parsing; runtime exceptions report a failed operation; logic errors produce an incorrect result without necessarily raising anything. Read a traceback from the failing operation back to its caller. Reproduce with the smallest input, state the expected result, inspect intermediate values, then fix the cause. Catch a specific exception only where you can respond meaningfully. Treat invalid user input as a boundary concern; assertions check programmer assumptions and can be disabled, so they are not input validation.</p>", "<p>语法错误阻止解析，运行时异常表示操作失败，逻辑错误可能不抛异常却给出错误结果。从失败操作沿回溯查看调用者。用最小输入复现，说明预期，检查中间值，再修复原因。只在能够合理响应的位置捕获具体异常。用户输入应在边界验证；断言可能被禁用，不能充当输入验证。</p>", "Should assert validate a user-supplied price?", "应使用 assert 验证用户价格吗？", "No. Explicitly reject invalid input; assertions may be disabled.", "不应。明确拒绝无效输入，因为断言可被禁用。")],
labs=[dict(file="m03_catalogue.py",title=P("A command-line catalogue", "命令行目录"),intro=P("Run the default search, then pass FOUNDATION as a command-line argument. The list comprehension constructs matches without changing the input.", "运行默认查询，再传入命令行参数 FOUNDATION。列表推导生成结果，不修改输入。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Search for an absent title.</li><li>Pass a quoted blank query.</li><li>Add an author field and write a separate author-search function.</li></ol>", "<ol><li>查询不存在的书名。</li><li>传入引号包围的空白查询。</li><li>增加作者字段及独立作者搜索函数。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>Absent prints no records. Blank input raises ValueError because an empty substring would otherwise match everything. Author search can use the same normalisation but must read book['author']; keep its validation separate from the CLI.</p>", "<p>缺失目标不打印记录。空白输入抛出 ValueError，否则空子串会匹配所有项。作者搜索可复用规范化规则，但读取 book['author']，验证逻辑与命令行接口分离。</p>")),dict(file="m03_state.py",title=P("Observe state and copies", "观察状态与复制"),intro=P("Predict the two lists after every statement. The + expression returns a new list; append mutates an existing list.", "逐条预测列表。+ 表达式返回新列表，append 修改现有列表。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Replace alias=original with original.copy().</li><li>Make add_book mutate its argument; update its contract and tests.</li><li>Explain why validation runs before the update.</li></ol>", "<ol><li>把别名赋值改为 original.copy()。</li><li>改成修改参数并更新约定与测试。</li><li>解释验证为何先于更新。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>With a copy, appending Foundation leaves original as [Dune]. A mutating version could use books.append(clean) and return None, but its tests must now expect the original to change. Validate first to avoid partially applying invalid requests.</p>", "<p>复制后追加 Foundation 不改变 original 的 [Dune]。修改版本可 append 后返回 None，但测试应预期原列表变化。先验证可避免部分应用无效请求。</p>"))],
exercises=[E(1,"Assignment", "赋值", "Trace a=2; b=a; a=a+1.", "跟踪 a=2、b=a、a=a+1。", "<p>a=3, b=2. The final assignment rebinds only a.</p>", "<p>a=3、b=2，最后仅重新绑定 a。</p>"),E(1,"Branch boundary", "分支边界", "For ages 17,18,19, evaluate age&gt;=18.", "对 17、18、19 求 age&gt;=18。", "<p>False, True, True. Testing the boundary distinguishes &gt; from &gt;=.</p>", "<p>False、True、True。边界案例可区分 &gt; 与 &gt;=。</p>"),E(2,"Loop total", "循环总和", "Trace total=0 then add each value in [2,4,6].", "从 total=0 开始逐项累加 [2,4,6]。", "<p>States after additions: 2,6,12. An empty list leaves total at zero.</p>", "<p>状态为 2、6、12；空列表使总和保持零。</p>"),E(2,"Aliasing", "别名", "After b=a; b.append('B'), why does a change?", "b=a 后 b.append('B')，为什么 a 改变？", "<p>Both names refer to one list. Rebinding b to a new list would be different from mutating that shared list.</p>", "<p>两个名称引用同一列表。把 b 绑定到新列表不同于修改共享列表。</p>"),E(2,"Return versus print", "返回与打印", "A function prints 7 but has no return. What value does its caller receive?", "函数打印 7 但没有 return，调用者收到什么？", "<p>None. Printing is a side effect, not a returned value.</p>", "<p>None。打印是副作用，不是返回值。</p>"),E(3,"Blank query", "空白查询", "Why validate after strip rather than only checking the original string?", "为什么 strip 后验证，而非仅检查原字符串？", "<p>A string of spaces is nonempty before strip but semantically blank afterwards. Normalise first, then validate the value the function will actually use.</p>", "<p>空格字符串在 strip 前非空，处理后为空；应验证函数实际使用的规范化值。</p>"),E(3,"Pure interface", "纯逻辑接口", "Design a function that filters affordable books without printing or mutation.", "设计不打印、不修改输入的价格筛选函数。", "<p>Accept books and maximum integer price_cents; validate a nonnegative limit, return [b for b in books if b['price_cents']&lt;=limit]. State that returned dictionaries remain shared unless copied.</p>", "<p>接受图书和非负整数价格上限，返回满足 b['price_cents']&lt;=limit 的列表。需说明返回的字典仍共享，除非另外复制。</p>"),E(2,"Debugging strategy", "调试策略", "Search unexpectedly matches all books. Give a minimal investigation.", "搜索意外匹配所有书，如何最小化调查？", "<p>Try one book and a blank query; inspect the normalised query. The empty substring belongs to every string. Add boundary validation and a regression case.</p>", "<p>用一本书与空白查询复现，检查规范化后的查询。空子串属于所有字符串；增加边界验证与回归案例。</p>")],
quiz=[Q("What does = do?", "= 做什么？", "Binds a name", "绑定名称", "Tests equality", "比较相等", "Proves a theorem", "证明定理", "Use == for equality.", "相等比较用 ==。"),Q("Which exits a function?", "哪个离开函数？", "return", "return", "continue", "continue", "append", "append", "return supplies a result and ends the call.", "return 返回结果并结束调用。"),Q("What is a dictionary?", "字典是什么？", "A key-to-value mapping", "键到值的映射", "Always a sorted list", "总是排序列表", "Only text", "只有文字", "Records can use named keys.", "记录可使用命名键。"),Q("Does b=a copy a list?", "b=a 复制列表吗？", "No", "不会", "Deeply", "深复制", "Only if empty", "仅空列表", "It shares the reference.", "它共享引用。"),Q("No explicit return gives what?", "没有显式 return 时返回什么？", "None", "None", "Last printed value", "最后打印值", "Always zero", "总是零", "Print does not become a return.", "打印不会自动成为返回值。"),Q("Best use of a specific exception handler?", "具体异常处理应放在哪里？", "Where a meaningful response is possible", "能够合理响应的位置", "Around all code, silently", "静默包围所有代码", "Only inside loops", "仅循环内", "Preserve diagnostic information and handle expected failures.", "保留诊断信息，处理预期失败。")],
pitfalls=[P("A shallow copy does not isolate nested mutable objects.", "浅复制不能隔离嵌套可变对象。"),P("Catching every exception and continuing can conceal corrupted state.", "捕获所有异常后继续可能掩盖错误状态。")],
reading=[(P("Python control flow", "Python 控制流"),"https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/controlflow.html",P("Read functions and argument passing; trace a call using local names.", "阅读函数与参数传递，跟踪局部名称。")),(P("Python data structures", "Python 数据结构"),"https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/datastructures.html",P("Read lists, dictionaries and comprehensions; rewrite the lab filter as a for loop.", "阅读列表、字典与推导式，把筛选改写为 for 循环。"))],
terms=[(P("Mutation", "修改"),P("Changing an existing object's state.", "改变现有对象状态。")),(P("Aliasing", "别名"),P("Multiple references to the same object.", "多个引用指向同一对象。")),(P("Exception", "异常"),P("A signal interrupting normal control flow.", "中断正常控制流的信号。"))],
review=P("<p>Explain the catalogue's input validation, list representation and return contract without looking at the code. Add one failing-input test. Module 04 introduces the mathematical language used to justify programs.</p>", "<p>不看代码解释目录的输入验证、列表表示与返回约定，增加一个失败输入测试。模块 04 将介绍论证程序所需的数学语言。</p>")))
